//
// ★ The sculpt as a SYNCHRONOUS factory, because three of its consumers do not run in a
// browser: `floraBounds` (the reticle's box), `mesh-icon` (the bag icon's software
// raster) and the node checks that read both. See `scripts/bake-flora-model.mts` for the
// argument in full. Re-bake after every picaso pass; the `.glb` remains the source.
//
// Positions are int16 over the model's own measured box (step ~2e-5 blocks). Normals are
// NOT baked — every consumer shades these flat and derives them from the positions.

